This project, titled "NextStepZ – Your First Step to the Future", is an academic
software project developed by Nguyễn Ngọc Thái and Đoàn Văn Nguyên,
students at the Vietnam-Korea University of Information Technology (VKU).

The project consists of:
  - An Android mobile application built with Kotlin and Jetpack Compose
  - A backend server built with NestJS (Node.js)
  - Supporting infrastructure and configuration files

This source code is made available strictly for educational evaluation,
academic review, and demonstration purposes.

Permission is granted to view this repository solely for learning and assessment.
Any other use requires explicit written consent from the authors.

